Package: r8benchR
Title: Rust-Native Types of the R8 Benchmark
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("E.D.", "Gennatas", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "gennatas@gmail.com")
Description: Declares the benchmark types Wide20 and GBM in Rust as
